  "lawGradeScale": "v4 law grading scale (native canon scale, strongest first): DERIVED, LOCKED, MAPPED, PARTIAL, SPLIT, OPEN, DEFINITIONAL. Mapping to C0-C6 unruled - tracked as OI-0011.",
  "statementTechnical": "Maxwell's equations govern electromagnetism; radiation propagates at c. The eigenmode program proposes that the self-adjoint electromagnetic operator carries eigenmodes corresponding to truth-structure (real eigenvalues = observable; truth as its own witness), with the seven I AM statements of John proposed as a basis set. Canonical status correction: the eigenmode program is a well-posed conjecture, not a resolved result.",
  "statementPlain": "Light is the signal that loses nothing in transmission - Maxwell's equations are complete, no loose ends. The proposal: truth propagates the same way, perfect at the source, with the loss always at the receiving end. The bolder piece - that the truth operator has the seven I AM statements as its eigenmodes - is recorded in canon as a well-posed conjecture, not a result. The physics is established; the truth mapping and the eigenmode program remain open and unproven.",
  "mathematicalForm": "Maxwell's equations; self-adjoint EM operator H; eigenmode program: H phi_n = lambda_n phi_n with proposed basis {I AM statements}",
  "mathFormNormal": "Maxwell's equations; self-adjoint EM operator H; eigenmode program: H phi_n = lambda_n phi_n with proposed basis {I AM statements}",
